Output message of the LLM: ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
To screen all 140 candidate studies, I will examine each title and abstract against the review's selection criteria:    
include prospective/retrospective cohort or case–control studies evaluating diagnostic accuracy of spectral‑domain OCT, 
HRT III, or GDx VCC/ECC for manifest glaucoma; exclude population‑based screening studies; exclude older test versions  
(time‑domain OCT, HRT I/II, GDx without VCC/ECC). I will then output the structured JSON with decisions, rationales, and
confidence levels.                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
<code>                                                                                                                  
import json                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                        
candidates = json.loads(candidates_json)                                                                                
studies = candidates['studies']                                                                                         
decisions = []                                                                                                          
included_count = 0                                                                                                      
excluded_count = 0                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
# We'll define a helper to add decision                                                                                 
def decide(study_index, title, decision, rationale, confidence):                                                        
    global included_count, excluded_count                                                                               
    if decision == "INCLUDE":                                                                                           
        included_count += 1                                                                                             
    else:                                                                                                               
        excluded_count += 1                                                                                             
